==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|nds|de}}, from {{etyl|gml|de}} {{term|vet|lang=gml}}, from {{etyl|osx|de}} ''*fētid'', from {{proto|Germanic|faitidaz|lang=de}}. Replaced {{etyl|de|-}} {{term|feist|lang=de}}, from {{etyl|goh|-}} {{term|feizit|lang=goh}}, from the same root.

===Adjective===
{{de-adj|comparative=fetter|superlative=fettesten}}

# [[fat]]
#: '''''Fette''' Menschen sind oft ungesund.''
#:: '''Fat''' people are often unhealthy.
#: ''Der Typ ist echt '''fett'''.''
#:: This guy is really '''cool'''.
#: ''Sie hat 'nen '''fetten''' Vertrag an Land gezogen.''
#:: She got a very '''profitable''' contract.
# [[bold]]

